; ATTR_TRN reads a 0x1000-byte VRAM payload via SendSGBTransferPacketStreamWithVRAMBufferFromBankedAddress.
; Kept conservative to avoid overlap with already-mapped symbols.
; Pan Docs layout for full 0x1000 payload: 000-FD1 = ATF0..ATF44 (45*90=4050 bytes), FD2-FFF unused.
; Each ATF is 20x18 attributes, 2 bits per cell (90 bytes total per ATF).
